{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nBooks are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws[[cite:obs-f1f08610df5a8f1c67368c3d7262d6d4e50aad7d \"Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws.\"]]. Every member may keep a book for a period specified in the loan table, which defines the maximum loan duration allowed.\n\nThe loan table specifies that a member may keep a book for twenty-one days.\n\n[[cite:obs-f1f08610df5a8f1c67368c3d7262d6d4e50aad7d \"Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws.\"]]","expected_sha256":"9d55948b2d38cb16dcfd3edc87c2cb901927f404388b75205cf8e276a3e06b34","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statement of the loan duration (twenty-one days) with citation, as required, while preserving the original citation and text about the loan table."}